          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "I'd rather put it this way than sell you an \"AI visibility index\" as if it were an exact metric. The tools that calculate one rely on sampling, and using them is fine as long as you know they're an approximation.",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
