                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "format": "",
                        "indent": 0,
                        "version": 1,
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "mode": "normal",
                            "text": "It doesn't separate it well by default. The most reliable approach is a custom channel with a regular expression that captures the assistants' domains, placed before Referral in the channel group.",
